{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TERRAFORM MARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/8a4905734d9466e562eebf303c05606f.poster.avif?t=1757875941\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/8a4905734d9466e562eebf303c05606f.webm?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/8a4905734d9466e562eebf303c05606f.mp4?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Mars step by step as you build powerful terraforming machines to increase atmospheric pressure, raise temperatures, enrich the soil with bacteria, and plant the first seeds of life. Grow forests and biomes, and incubate animals, and watch the barren surface transform into a living, breathing world just like Earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GATHER RESOURCES, CRAFT, SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/984167f40842416e40278677eb8415ca.poster.avif?t=1757875941\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/984167f40842416e40278677eb8415ca.webm?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/984167f40842416e40278677eb8415ca.mp4?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness Mars\u2019 raw resources, refine materials, and use 3D printers to build machines and structures. Manage power, unlock blueprints, upgrade your tools and craft everything you need to survive in a harsh and changing environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE MOBILE BASES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/68aba5f9e23342775c7e7a84ecd22a31.poster.avif?t=1757875941\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/68aba5f9e23342775c7e7a84ecd22a31.webm?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/68aba5f9e23342775c7e7a84ecd22a31.mp4?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize modular rovers, attach functional modules like batteries, storage, and mining lasers, and chain them into convoys. Drive across the planet, mine on the go, and create fully mobile or stationary outposts for deep exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/341ce88d80232470cc0b888797a8ab9d.poster.avif?t=1757875941\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/341ce88d80232470cc0b888797a8ab9d.webm?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/341ce88d80232470cc0b888797a8ab9d.mp4?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE MYSTERY OF LONG-LOST LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/fac3c30dbfa473c2ba6e901c266c6f7d.poster.avif?t=1757875941\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/fac3c30dbfa473c2ba6e901c266c6f7d.webm?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/extras/fac3c30dbfa473c2ba6e901c266c6f7d.mp4?t=1757875941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned terraforming stations, ancient machines, and wrecked ships scattered across the planet. Visit orbital platforms, uncover forgotten technology, and piece together what happened to Earth\u2014and those who came before you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576870?t=1757875941","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/99d7593f2d826431966156240d09c1ebafdcd625/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757875941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/687951e98fc8cd46562acad6e25ab65e59b30878/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757875941","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576870/687951e98fc8cd46562acad6e25ab65e59b30878/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757875941","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TERRAFORM MARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\